仓库核对记录，并等价调整 Markdown 换行。README 原文完整保留。\n- M0—M5、独立控制议题、DEC-001—013、11 个核心章节、候选方程与观测关系完整。\n- 16 个仓库相对链接及 Issue 历史证据路径存在；占位符检查、代码/数学块配对检查通过。\n- `git diff --cached --check` 通过；提交仅含 README.md 与 docs/roadmap/TTO-roadmap.md，共 318 行新增。\n- PR 创建后回读远程 Issue/PR 正文、README、路线图及 PR 文件列表，核对真实入口与提交身份。\n\n本次没有重新运行模型/风扇测试，没有访问真实设备，不将此前80/88项核验计作本PR新测试。\n\n## 范围\n\n不修改运行代码、依赖、安装器、配置、测试、wheel或既有证据；不实施灰箱/在线学习；不部署或调速。关联主Issue用于长期跟踪，本PR合并不应关闭它。\n\n本PR创建后交由负责人审阅，不自动合并。\n","created_at":"2026-10-11T23:34:03Z","updated_at":"2026-10-11T23:40:21Z","closed_at":"2026-10-11T23:40:21Z","merged_at":"2026-10-11T23:40:21Z","merge_commit_sha":"5feb66ff521551dad9dd0bd8e30e8c3c3d636eec","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/massif-01/Tianshan-thermal-observer/pulls/2/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/massif-01/Tianshan-thermal-observer/pulls/2/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/massif-01/Tianshan-thermal-observer/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/massif-01/Tianshan-thermal-observer/issues/2/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/massif-01/Tianshan-thermal-observer/statuses/28ed31fdc2713bb6af70c7806fdc8ef646c945dd","head":{"label":"massif-01:docs/tto-roadmap-and-decisions-20261012","ref":"docs/tto-roadmap-and-decisions-20261012","sha":"28ed31fdc2713bb6af70c7806fdc8ef646c945dd","user":{"login":"massif-01","id":176381099,"node_id":"U_kgDOCoNcqw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/176381099?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/massif-01","html_url":"https://github.com/massif-01","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/massif-01/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/massif-01/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/massif-01/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/massif-01/starred{/own